SUMMARY:🌿 Ancient Medicine for Modern Healing 🌿
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**🌿 Ancient Medicine
  for Modern Healing 🌿**\n**Acupuncture 101: Anxiety\, Depression\, Stre
 ss\, Disease & Pain**\n*Presented by Ramsey Higgins\, Licensed Acupuncture
  Physician*\n\n🗓 Sunday\, August 2\n🕧 12:45 PM\n💖 Suggested Love 
 Offering $20\n\n✨ Discover how one of the world's oldest healing arts ca
 n support your health\, balance\, and well-being in today's fast-paced wor
 ld.\n\nJoin Ramsey Higgins\, Licensed Acupuncture Physician\, for an engag
 ing introduction to the timeless wisdom of acupuncture and its role as a f
 orm of Spiritual Medicine. Explore how this holistic approach works with t
 he body's natural healing intelligence to promote greater harmony in mind\
 , body\, and spirit.\n\nDuring this informative presentation\, you'll disc
 over:\n🌱 The universal foundations and philosophy of acupuncture\n🧠 
 How acupuncture may help reduce anxiety\, depression\, and stress\n💚 Wa
 ys it can support the body's natural healing process for pain and disease\
 n⚖️ How balancing energy can contribute to greater health and vitality
 \n🙏 The connection between spiritual well-being and physical wellness\n
 ❓ Time for questions and conversation\n\nWhether you're simply curious o
 r considering acupuncture as part of your wellness journey\, this presenta
 tion offers practical insights into an ancient healing tradition that cont
 inues to benefit millions around the world.\n\nEveryone is welcome—bring
  a friend and come explore a holistic path to greater well-being!\n\n#Acup
 uncture #HolisticHealing #SpiritualMedicine #MindBodySpirit #WellnessJourn
 ey #StressRelief #AnxietySupport #NaturalHealing #CommunityWellness #Cente
 rForSpiritualLivingAsheville #CSLAsheville #CommunityCommonsAsheville #Ins
 piredLiving
