SUMMARY:🎶✨ The Science & Alchemy of Sound
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🎶✨ The Science &
  Alchemy of Sound\n\n## A Sacred Sonic Immersion with Jane Cuva\n\n📅 **
 Sunday\, August 2\, 2026**\n🕓 **4:00 PM – 8:30 PM**\n📍 **Center fo
 r Spiritual Living Asheville**\n💝 **Suggested Love Offering: $11–33**
  *(No one turned away for lack of funds. Email us for volunteer opportunit
 ies.)*\n\nPrepare for an unforgettable afternoon and evening of sound\, co
 mmunity\, movement\, and exploration.\n\nFollowing her keynote presentatio
 n at PsiGames\, renowned environmental audio alchemist **Jane Cuva** joins
  us for a transformational experience exploring the healing\, connective\,
  and expansive possibilities of sound.\nTogether we'll journey through med
 itation\, sacred cacao\, music\, movement\, and immersive sonic frequencie
 s designed to inspire deeper presence\, creativity\, and inner awareness.\
 n\nWhether you're curious about the science of sound\, drawn to mystical e
 xperiences\, or simply looking for a unique community gathering\, this eve
 nt offers an opportunity to listen deeply\, connect authentically\, and ce
 lebrate together.\n\n## 🌳 Event Schedule\n\n🌳 **4:00 PM – Tree Tem
 ple Gathering**\n\n* Opening Meditation & Affirmation\n* Gather beneath As
 heville's beloved 365-year-old Elder Oak for a grounding community ceremon
 y.\n\n🍫 **Cymatic Cacao Experience**\n\n* Experience a unique cacao cer
 emony accompanied by immersive sound designed to cultivate presence\, hear
 t-centered awareness\, and meaningful connection.\n\n🥗 **5:00 PM – Co
 mmunity Potluck**\n\n* Weather permitting outdoors (otherwise indoors)\n* 
 Bring a favorite dish to share.\n* Please label potential allergens.\n* Bo
 nus gratitude if you bring your own plate\, utensils\, and cup to help red
 uce waste. 🌎\n\n🤝 **6:00 PM – Meet & Greet**\n\n* Connect with Jan
 e Cuva and fellow participants before the evening presentation.\n\n🎵 **
 6:30 PM – The Science & Alchemy of Sound**\n\n* A multimedia sonic exper
 ience exploring:\n* 🎼 Sound\, frequency\, and consciousness\n* ❤️ H
 eart–mind coherence\n* 🎨 Symbolic storytelling through music\n* 🔮 
 The evolving relationship between sound\, creativity\, and human potential
 \n\n💃 **7:15 PM – Ecstatic Dance**\n**Telekinetic Techno TRANSMISSION
 S**\nA contemplative\, immersive dance journey where rhythm\, movement\, a
 nd sound come together in celebration.\n✨ Let go of expectations...\n✨
  Allow yourself to listen deeply...\n✨ Move freely...\n✨ Let the sound
  take you where it will.\nWe look forward to sharing this extraordinary ev
 ening of community\, music\, exploration\, and inspiration.\n🎟️ **Sug
 gested Love Offering:** $11–33\n💜 **No one is turned away for lack of
  funds.** Contact us to learn about volunteer opportunities.\n#CSLAshevill
 e #CommunityCommonsAsheville #SoundHealing #SacredSound #EcstaticDance #Me
 ditation #ConsciousCommunity #HeartMindCoherence #TransformationalExperien
 ce #SacredCacao #SpiritualAwakening #LiveMusic #Frequency #InspiredLiving
