SUMMARY:🌟 A Course in Miracles Study Group
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**A Course In Miracles 
 Study Group**\n\n*✨ All are welcome to join us for A Course in Miracles 
 at the Center for Spiritual Living Asheville!*\n\n📅 When: First & Third
  Fridays of each month\n🕐 Time: 1:00 PM – 2:30 PM\n💜 Love Offering
  to support the Community\n\n**🌟 About Our Gatherings**\n🃏 During ea
 ch meeting\, we each choose a card from the "Miracle Cards" — inviting S
 pirit to guide us to exactly the right message for ourselves or the group 
 in that moment.\n📖 When time allows\, we also share a lesson from the W
 orkbook together.\n🚪 You are welcome to join at any time — no need to
  start from the beginning!\n\n**💡 New to ACIM? Here's the heart of it:*
 *\nA miracle is a shift in perception from fear to Love.\n"Nothing real ca
 n be threatened\, nothing unreal exists — therein lies the peace of God.
 "\n\n☮️ Come join us for some POG (Peace of God)!\n\n🙏 Wishing you 
 a year filled with Miracles\, Love & Light!\n\nWith love\,\nMarla (Facilit
 ator) & Robin (Co-Facilitator)\n\n#ACourseInMiracles #ACIM #PeaceOfGod #Sp
 iritualLiving #CSLAsheville #CommunityCommons #MiracleCards #ShiftInPercep
 tion #LoveAndLight #Miracles #SpiritualGrowth #Asheville #AshevilleEvents 
 #MindfulCommunity #InnerPeace
